&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering, Data, Commercial, and Operations teams to translate business needs into scalable product solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and prioritize product backlogs based on business impact, data accuracy, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze marketplace KPIs and identify opportunities to improve reporting, data quality, and platform insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product delivery across cross-functional teams, ensuring clear documentation, stakeholder alignment, and communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years (Product Manager) or 4+ years (Senior Product Manager) of hands-on product management experience in Programmatic Advertising (SSPs, Ad Exchanges, DSPs, or Ad Servers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of OpenRTB protocols, RTB auction mechanics, and programmatic advertising metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing analytics, reporting, dashboards, or data-driven products within an AdTech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of data structures, data flows, and reporting requirements, with the ability to collaborate closely with technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset, attention to detail, and the ability to turn complex data into actionable product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with structured prioritization frameworks and Agile development methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to Have: Experience with SQL, BI tools, data visualization platforms, or high-volume advertising data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
